===== Project 1 Pseudocode =====

── BankAccount (Base Class) ─────────────────────────────────
  ATTRIBUTES:
    firstName, lastName, accountID, balance (starts at 0)

  METHODS:
    deposit(amount)       → balance = balance + amount
    withdrawal(amount)    → balance = balance - amount
    accountSummary()      → print firstName, lastName, accountID, balance
    getters / setters     → for all attributes


── CheckingAccount (Extends BankAccount) ────────────────────
  ADDITIONAL ATTRIBUTE:
    interestRate

  METHODS:
    processWithdrawal(amount):
      newBalance = balance - amount
      IF newBalance < 0:
        deduct $30 overdraft fee
        print negative balance + fee notice
      ELSE:
        withdraw normally

    displayAccount():
      call accountSummary() from BankAccount
      print interestRate


── Main (Testing) ───────────────────────────────────────────
  CREATE BankAccount("Ahmed", "Lotfey", 1001)
    deposit $500      → print summary
    withdraw $200     → print summary
    test setters/getters

  CREATE CheckingAccount("Ahmed", "Lotfey", 2001, 2.5%)
    display account
    deposit $300      → display account
    withdraw $100     → no overdraft → display account
    withdraw $500     → overdraft triggered → display account
    set new interest rate → print rate
